    "Same-edition William Frist (one TN cell) corroborates the reviewed Bill form. CDIR-2005-07-11-TN-S-1 explicitly links WILLIAM H. (BILL) FRIST to F000439; cross-edition identity evidence only.",
    "Seven same-edition Michael B. Enzi WY cells corroborate the reviewed Mike form. Canonical E000285 has the exact 105th Senate term; no global nickname expansion.",
    "Exact source typo review: seven Walter B. Jones NC cells corroborate this Banking and Financial Services cell. Pin J000255, not a generic Walder correction.",
    "Three James H. Maloney CT cells corroborate the reviewed Jim form. Carolyn Maloney of NY is a separate candidate and is not eligible for this reviewed identity.",
    "CDIR-2003-07-11-TX-H-21 explicitly links LAMAR S. SMITH to S000583. Target edition supplies all four assignments; target 105th House district 21 term required.",
    "Three Robert L. Ehrlich, Jr. MD cells corroborate this reviewed Budget nickname cell. Pin E000093 and the 105th House district 2 term.",
    "CDIR-1997-06-04-OK-H-2 links THOMAS ALLEN COBURN and Tom Coburn to C000560 (H/105/OK). Reviewed Tom A. Coburn preserves the explicit Allen initial; no runtime initial rule.",
    "CDIR-2005-07-11-SC-S-1 explicitly links LINDSEY O. GRAHAM to G000359. Cross-edition identity only; these assignments require the 105th House district 3 term, not a Senate term.",
    "The target source explicitly supplies Mark in parentheses; three other SC cells print Mark Sanford. Pin S000051 without a global Marshall-to-Mark rule.",
    "Exact House Oversight typo review: six John L. Mica FL cells corroborate M000689. No generic Mice-to-Mica correction.",
    "Three same-edition Edward Royce CA cells corroborate the reviewed conflicting middle initial. Pin R000487 (canonical Edward R. Royce); preserve the original printed cell.",
    "Three correctly spelled Sheila Jackson Lee TX cells corroborate the three reviewed Shelia cells. Pin J000032; no general spelling correction.",
    "CDIR-1997-06-04-FL-H-4 links TILLIE FOWLER to F000328 (H/105/FL), but does not supply K. This is a reviewed extra-initial inference for the unique district 4 candidate, not an explicit alias.",
    "Six same-edition John McHugh NY cells corroborate the reviewed conflicting H. initial. Pin M000472 (canonical John M. McHugh), with exact source-context and term guards.",
    "Three Bob Riley AL cells corroborate the bare surname in National Security and its two children. Pin R000258; no generic surname-only matching.",
    "CDIR-1997-06-04-ME-H-1 links THOMAS H. ALLEN to A000357 (H/105/ME); its biography explicitly names National Security. Reviewed Tom Allen is a nickname inference for the unique district 1 candidate, not an explicit Tom alias.",
